config QTI_DISPLAY_SM6150
	bool "Qualcomm SDE display driver for SM6150"
	depends on DRM=y && ARCH_QCOM && OF && MMU
	depends on !DRM_MSM
	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
	select DRM_DISPLAY_HELPER
	select DRM_MIPI_DSI
	select DRM_PANEL
	select BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
	select SYNC_FILE
	select QCOM_UBWC_CONFIG
	help
	  The SDE display driver of Qualcomm's display-drivers, built into
	  the kernel for SM6150 with its target config: the SDE and DSI,
	  without DisplayPort, writeback and the RSC. It provides the msm_drm
	  interface the vendor display HALs use.

	  It takes the place of the drm/msm driver, which cannot be built
	  along with it.
